OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThe 2026 Commonwealth Games have been
OL,8,Fbrought to an end in spectacular
OL,9,Ffashion with music, dancing and a
OL,10,Ffireworks display over the River Clyde.
OL,12,FThousands of spectators packed into
OL,13,Fthe Glasgow Hydro on Sunday evening
OL,14,Ffor the closing ceremony, which
OL,15,Fbrought down the curtain on 11 days of
OL,16,Fsporting action at venues across the
OL,17,Fcity.
OL,19,FThe event also marked the handover to
OL,20,Fthe Indian city of Amdavad, which will
OL,21,Fhost the Games in 2030.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThe ceremony featured a packed line-up
OL,8,Fof Scottish music talent alongside
OL,9,Fsome of India's biggest dance and
OL,10,Fmusic stars, in what was billed as "a
OL,11,Fspectacle that captures the spirit of
OL,12,Ftwo nations coming together on one
OL,13,Fstage".
OL,15,FThe Duke of Edinburgh, who is vice
OL,16,Fpatron of Commonwealth Sport, also
OL,17,Fspoke during the ceremony to bring
OL,18,FGlasgow 2026 formally to a close.
OL,26,@rD@dOUuD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThe event began with the vast hall
OL,8,Fplunged into darkness, with only
OL,9,Fwaving phone lights visible, and some
OL,10,Fof the audience chanting "No Scotland,
OL,11,Fno party".
OL,13,FThe lights then came up for an on-
OL,14,Fstage performance by Scottish singer
OL,15,FSandi Thom, and a music video by
OL,16,Fsinger Cammy Barnes projected onto the
OL,17,Fbig screen.
OL,26,@rD@ZOUsD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FA procession of athletes, volunteers
OL,8,Fand the flags of the 74 competing
OL,9,Fnations and territories then entered
OL,10,Fto the tune of a rousing pop anthem,
OL,11,Fbelted out by Australian artist Delta
OL,12,FGoodrem, who shimmered under the
OL,13,Flights in a sparkly white dress.
OL,15,FThe many Team Scotland representatives
OL,16,Fsported kilts and traffic cone hats,
OL,17,Fin a nod to the Glaswegian tradition
OL,18,Fof "coning" statues, which captured
OL,19,Fthe world's attention during the
OL,20,Frecent Fifa World Cup.
OL,26,@zD@DOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FAs the procession converged on the
OL,8,Fcentral point of the Saltire-shaped
OL,9,Fstaging, Delta Goodrem was joined on
OL,10,Fstage by Cammy Barnes, with the two
OL,11,Fsinging a duet while some of the
OL,12,Fathletes danced and waved flags, and
OL,13,Fthe crowd clapped along.
OL,15,FThis was followed by pipers, a brass
OL,16,Fband and kilted drummers taking to the
OL,17,Fstage to play the riff from the Primal
OL,18,FScream song Loaded, accompanied by
OL,19,Ftracksuit-clad dancers, and a montage
OL,20,Fof highlights from this year's Games
OL,21,Fprojected onto the big screen.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FA video of Scottish writer Jackie Kay
OL,8,Freading her poem Dear Green Hollow
OL,9,Fthen took the intensity down a notch.
OL,11,FThe poem included the lines: "May you
OL,12,Fleave with the spirit of Glasgow's
OL,13,Fgood grace, bottled and kept safe.
OL,15,F"And in India, in four years' time,
OL,16,Fmay the Glasgow genie come oot the
OL,17,Fbottle in Amdavad in Gujarat to wish
OL,18,Fyou well."
OL,26,@sD@^OUwD@AOUzD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FAfter a performance from Scottish band
OL,8,FElephant Sessions the handover
OL,9,Fceremony began, officially
OL,10,Ftransferring host duties to the city
OL,11,Fof Amdavad.
OL,13,FThe lowering of the Commonwealth Sport
OL,14,Fflag on the concourse outside the
OL,15,FHydro was shown on the big screen, and
OL,16,Fthe audience heard speeches from the
OL,17,FGlasgow 2026 chairman George Black and
OL,18,FCommonwealth Sport president Donald
OL,19,FRukare.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FScottish para-athlete Melanie Woods
OL,8,Fwas also named winner of the David
OL,9,FDixon award, which is given to an
OL,10,F"outstanding athlete" at each
OL,11,FCommonwealth Games.
OL,13,FTo complete the handover, the
OL,14,FCommonwealth Sport flag was brought
OL,15,Fonto the stage and passed from
OL,16,FScottish to Indian officials, ending
OL,17,Fup with Harsh Sanghavi, deputy first
OL,18,Fminister of Gujarat province, who
OL,19,Fbowed when it was placed into his
OL,20,Fhands.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThis was followed by a three-act
OL,8,Fperformance welcoming Amdavad as the
OL,9,Fnext host city, featuring some of
OL,10,FIndia's biggest dance and music stars.
OL,12,FDancers in brightly coloured costumes
OL,13,Fpacked the stage for a performance
OL,14,Fcelebrating 150 years of Vande
OL,15,FMataram, the national song of India
OL,16,Fand a symbol of unity, led by actress
OL,17,Fand former Miss World Manushi Chhillar.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThis was followed by a duet featuring
OL,8,FIndian sitarist Rishab Rikhiram and
OL,9,FScottish piper Ross Ainslie, in a
OL,10,Ftwist on a classical Indian duet known
OL,11,Fas a jugalbandi, accompanied by
OL,12,Fdancers in gold dresses.
OL,14,FThe performance ended with a tribute
OL,15,Fto the Indian state of Gujarat
OL,16,Ffeaturing lively performances of some
OL,17,Fof India's best-known songs, composed
OL,18,Fand performed by Shankar Mahadevan and
OL,19,Fhis sons Siddharth and Shivam, and
OL,20,FGujarati singer Bhoom Trivedi.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThe Duke of Edinburgh then made his
OL,8,Fentrance to bring this year's games to
OL,9,Fa close, with a speech thanking the
OL,10,Fathletes, volunteers, officials and
OL,11,Forganisers.
OL,13,F"You have inspired us and hopefully
OL,14,Ffuture generations. You have also
OL,15,Fdemonstrated what unites us. Thank you
OL,16,Fall, thank you Glasgow," he said.
OL,18,FThe brief address ended: "On behalf of
OL,19,FHis Majesty the King our patron, and
OL,20,Fin the name of Commonwealth Sport, I
OL,21,Fproclaim Glasgow 2026 closed."
OL,26,@uD@AOUxD@XO]zD@ZOU}D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThe speech was followed by a "ceilidh
OL,8,Ffor the Commonwealth" organised by
OL,9,Fstreet dance group Diversity, with
OL,10,Fvolunteers and some of the athletes
OL,11,Fjoining the dancing.
OL,13,FGlasgow 2026 hero Mop Man also made an
OL,14,Fappearance, prompting rapturous cheers
OL,15,Fas he delivered his signature cleaning-
OL,16,Finspired dance routine to the strains
OL,17,Fof club classic Bits And Pieces.
OL,19,FGlasgow rockers Simple Minds then took
OL,20,Fto the stage to bring events to a
OL,21,Fclose inside the Hydro.
OL,26,@oD@^OUpD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
