PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785714477
OL,3,CMusic, dancing and fireworks as
OL,4,CGlasgow brings Commonwealth Games to a
OL,5,Cclose
OL,7,FThey finished with their hit Don't You
OL,8,F(Forget About Me), while outside the
OL,9,Fvenue the skies were lit up by a
OL,10,Fdramatic fireworks display.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
